#: internal/web/templates/dashboard/onboarding.html:271
msgid ""
"Use an authenticator app (Google Authenticator, Authy, etc.) to generate "
"one-time codes."
msgstr ""
"Använd en autentiseringsapp (Google Authenticator, Authy, etc.) för att "
